        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Scared to Death"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "What are you afraid of? Vancouver’s weirdest magician Aleister Crane needs to find out in a new magic show featuring ghouls, ghosts, and things that go bump in the night. WIll YOU be Scared to Death?!?\r\n\r\n<strong>Ages: 13+</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Aleister Crane Productions</strong>"
      }
    ],
