  {
    "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/temporary/36c4cbb8-de30-4459-8d5b-8e5bb37f5cec",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g3226980"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/stec_event/camp-monarch/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.phtheatre.org/stec_event/camp-monarch/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Camp Monarch"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<strong>July 7–18, 2025 (Monday to Friday, two weeks)\r\n9:00 AM – 3:00 PM</strong>\r\n\r\nWe offer <strong>Before and After Camp Care</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li><strong>Before Care</strong>: 8:00 AM – 9:00 AM</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>After Care</strong>: 3:00 PM – 5:00 PM\r\n<em>Please note: After Camp Care is not available on the final performance day.</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nNow in its 23rd year, <strong>Camp Monarch</strong> is a joyful, screen-free summer day camp for children ages <strong>5–12</strong> that nurtures creativity, confidence, and collaboration through the arts. Campers spend each day rotating through four core disciplines—<strong>visual art, music, dance, and drama</strong>—led by a team of professional artists and experienced educators who specialize in working with children.\r\n\r\nHeld at <strong>Presentation House Theatre</strong>, Camp Monarch offers an inspiring setting where kids can explore their imaginations, build new friendships, and experience the magic of creating something together. The camp culminates in an exciting end-of-session performance where campers proudly share their creative work with family and friends.\r\n\r\nWhether your child is outgoing or shy, brand-new to the arts or full of experience, Camp Monarch is a place where they will feel safe, supported, and celebrated for who they are."
      }
    ],
