        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<strong>Friday, January 31, 2025\r\n7:00 PM</strong>\r\n\r\nJokers Canada is bringing a fresh lineup of Canada’s best comedians back to North Vancouver. Every previous Jokers Canada North Van show has sold out!\r\n\r\n<strong>Ages: 19+ (No Minors)</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>A Jokers Canada Production</strong>"
      }
