    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with our Holiday Singalong!\r\n<div></div>\r\nCome gather around for a festive singalong of holiday favourites! We’ll bring the song sheets, you bring your voices, and together we’ll make some holiday cheer. A casual and warm embrace of the songs of the season.\r\n<div></div>\r\nBring your family, friends, and loved ones all together for unforgettable night of music and merriment. Make new memories to treasure for the years to come! With the musical stylings of Andy Toth and Patrick Ray!\r\n<div></div>\r\n<strong>Festive fun for all ages!</strong>"
      }
