        "@value": "Larke Miller and The Seven Dwarfs"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A fun comedy show with comedians coming together and telling their funniest jokes. With the exception of Larke Miller and Special Guest, Jeff Palmer, this line-up of comedians might be lacking in height but are here to bring you sidesplitting jokes and uproarious laughter!\r\n\r\n<strong>Ages: 14+</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>A Burnout Entertainment Production presented in association with the PHT Creative Hub</strong>"
      }
    ],
