    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Baking Time"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_tta-container\" data-vc-action=\"collapse\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-tabs vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-classic vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-spacing-1 vc_tta-tabs-position-top vc_tta-controls-align-left\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_tta-panels-container\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_tta-panels\">\r\n<div id=\"1692127065369-b3a6add3-1bec\" class=\"vc_tta-panel vc_active\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_tta-panel-body\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\r\nIt’s Baking Time! The smell of freshly baked bread drifts through the audience as master bakers Bun and Bap try to contain a sticky situation – they’ve over-yeasted a lively batch of dough and it’s GROWING. When Yeasty Beasty rises up and begins to chase newly baked baby Loafy through forests, oceans, and floury snowstorms, Bap and Bun spring to action. But what are they to do?\r\n\r\nIt’s a recipe for pure joy! Expect baking antics, lively music, and lots of opportunities for the audience to safely join in the fun.\r\n\r\n<strong>For ages 3-7 and their favourite grown-ups!</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Co-Production with Oily Cart Theatre and Presentation House Theatre</strong>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"1692127065412-8bfa1e9c-44d9\" class=\"vc_tta-panel\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"1692127985168-c8bd423a-cad9\" class=\"vc_tta-panel\" data-vc-content=\".vc_tta-panel-body\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>"
      }
    ],
