        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Window Outside"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Delicately funny, cleverly truthful, and beautifully told, The Window Outside is a raw, heartfelt and powerful story of love.\r\n\r\nA Liz Connors Production\r\n\r\nWritten by Belinda Lopez\r\n\r\nThemes include ageing, illness and end of life choices."
      }
    ],
