      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Carbon Copy Kid"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A dark and dirty tale. In a mythical, larger-than-life Quebecois family of 57 children, Terryy seems to be the only rational one! (And the only good-looking one, too!) Fed up with his ridiculous circumstances, Terryy seeks an all-powerful reason behind his family’s woes, even if he has to invent a story to explain it all.\r\n\r\nFOR AGES 12+ (ADULT)\r\n\r\nProduced by Theatre de la Pire Espece\r\nPresented by Presentation House Theatre"
      }
    ],
