      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">A joyful celebration of the songs of David King, a self-described “Foolish Man”. One show only!\r\n</span>Performed by Peter Hill, Ken Dalgleish, Boyd Norman, Tim Enns, Dave Hurtubise, Amy King, Emily King, &amp; Wanda Nowicki."
      }
